   "text": "Trench. Khazraj, see Aws and Khazraj. Medina, Mddinah; also called Yathrib during the time of Prophet Muhammad. the famous Battle of Badr took place, mad'u, one who is invited or called between the Quraish of Makkah and the Muslims of Medina in 624 AD. Banu Hashim, a clan of the Quraysh tribe"
