   "text": "towards God. mujahid, one who struggles in the way of God. to which Prophet Muhammad belonged. Omar, also (Umar) or Omar bin al Khattab Battle of the Trench, March-April 627AD; (579-644 AD); a close companion of the Prophet; the 2nd Muslim Caliph. Qital, armed warfare. shahadat, witness shirk, association of partners with God. tab’een, making the message of God clear"
